0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></div>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">Software &amp; SD Card Support</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">Pre-installed games and OS are provided by Anbernic. For software issues, users must re-flash the SD card by downloading the official firmware here: <a href=\"https://win.anbernic.com/download/\" style=\"color: #2563eb; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #2563eb;\" target=\"_blank\">Anbernic Download Center</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #fff1f2; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e11d48\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"15\"></line><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"15\"></line></svg></div>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">Final Sale Policy</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">We exclusively sell <strong>brand-new products</strong>. As Anbernic does not accept returns, all sales are final. We do not accept returns or offer refunds. Please conduct thorough research before completing your purchase.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 12px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e1e4e8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Authentic Products \u2022 Professional Support</span></div>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKbu2qL2jDGB165WJw_p3yDpd9OillwWU8fkSjBuu991G2uLn2AbwM4512vaBAqBKLoE2kQ3TrAkK8VoYK6stdOpi