,0,0.08); font-family: 'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #111827;\">\ud83d\udd25 Anbernic <span style=\"color: #16a34a;\">RG35XX Pro</span>\n</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; color: #6b7280;\">3.5\" IPS \u2022 H700 Quad-Core \u2022 Linux 64-bit \u2022 Dual TF Slots \u2022 HDMI Out</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #111827; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Colors</strong><br>White / Black / Transparent Teal</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Display</strong><br>3.5\" IPS, full viewing angle<br>OCA full lamination \u2022 640 \u00d7 480</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #fb923c; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Processor (CPU)</strong><br>H700 Quad-Core ARM Cortex-A53 @ 1.5 GHz</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f97316; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Graphics (GPU)</strong><br>Dual-Core G31 MP2</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Memory (RAM)</strong><br>1 GB RAM</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Storage</strong><br>64 GB TF / MicroSD included<br>Dual TF slots \u2014 expandable up to 512 GB</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Operating System</strong><br>Linux 64-bit</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Game Support</strong><br>30+ emulators &amp; ported games<br>User-downloadable game formats</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Wireless</strong><br>Wi\u2011Fi 2.4G / 5G (802.11 a/b/g/n/ac)<br>Bluetooth 4.2</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #84cc16; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Multimedia</strong><br>Video &amp; music player<br>File manager \u2022 TXT e\u2011book \u2022 WiliWili online playback</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #facc15; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Languages</strong><br>CN / EN / JP / KR / RU / FR / DE / ES / PT</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Speaker</strong><br>High-fidelity built-in speaker</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #eab308; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Battery</strong><br>3200 mAh polymer lithium \u2014 up to 7 hours</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #c084fc; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Charging</strong><br>5V / 1.5A \u2014 supports USB\u2011C to USB\u2011C charging</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #a855f7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Extra Functions</strong><br>Wireless &amp; wired controllers<br>Bluetooth controllers \u2022 HDMI TV out<br>Vibration \u2022 Online multiplayer \u2022 Streaming</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #059669; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Accessories</strong><br>Type\u2011C charging cable \u2022 Gift box \u2022 Manual</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #64748b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Dimensions</strong><br>128 \u00d7 81 \u00d7 22 mm</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #334155; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Weight</strong><br>191 g</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Reason to Buy</strong><br><span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">Compact retro classic \u2022 Wi\u2011Fi multiplayer \u2022 HDMI output</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 20px;\">Specifications may vary by configuration and region.</p>\n</div>",
